<title>USA: Smartflex names Hohener CFO.</title>
<headline>Smartflex names Hohener CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TUSTIN, Calif. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smartflex Systems Inc Monday named John Hohener to the post of vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Hohener replaces Al Castleman, who has moved on toward a planned retirement.</p>
<p>Hohener has been with Smartflex Systems for more than nine years as corporate controller and treasurer.</p>
